| `attack-path-analysis` | Security Team Operating Model, Threat Model, validation evidence, affected assets | `security-team.md`, deployment/ingress/IaC evidence when relevant | Implementation files outside the affected path | full-form |
| `remediation-verification` | Security Team Operating Model, validated finding, fix diff, Quality Gates | `security-team.md`, regression tests, owning implementer notes | New discovery outside nearby bypass checks | full-form |
| `disclosure-triage` | Security Team Operating Model, authorization/scope, report details | `security-team.md`, disclosure/CVD references when needed | Source files not needed to determine scope or reproduction | full-form |
| `mcp-write` | MCP approval gate, Security & Audit Matrix | Plugin/MCP rendering reference | Architecture Decisions detail | full-form |
| `replication` | Replication contract, Plan Handoff Contract, Output Contract | Models reference for explicit overrides | Project-specific quality gate detail | full-form |
| `release` | Quality Gates, manifests, version sync rules | Runtime update audit | Long architecture rationale | full-form |
